ween two times. Returns event handles. Reads only.\\ncalendar.read — Read an event with its attendees and their responses. Reads only.\\ncalendar.free_busy — Busy intervals for each attendee between two times, in time_zone. Reads only.\\ncalendar.create — Create an event. With attendees, invitations go out at once. Notifies other people.\\ncalendar.update — Change an event. With attendees, updates go out at once. Pass time_zone with start or end. Notifies other people.\\ncalendar.respond — Accept, tentatively accept or decline an invitation. The organizer is told. Notifies other people.\\ncalendar.cancel — Cancel an event the person organizes; attendees are told. Cannot be undone. Google sends attendees its own cancellation notice; a comment is not delivered.\\n\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_019dbecd8a3a6734016af128052e3487d09eaa8eab543c99b4\",\"call_id\":\"call_J64xcA2dZKv9CscIo3YutzvG\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"date\\\",\\\"timeout\\\":30}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_J64xcA2dZKv9CscIo3YutzvG\",\"output\":\"Sun Nov  8 17:55:17 PST 2026\\n\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be04-3cf8-75da-a5e3-4a40cd2ba068\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
