ly message**\\n\\nI need to draft a reply message for an email, and it seems like the recipient might be auto-filled from the thread, but I should make it explicit. The subject could be something like \\\"RE: Q3 budget numbers.\\\" In the body, I should mention bringing the information to the meeting and include a link. I'll go ahead and create that draft to make it easier for the user!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_019dbecd8a3a6734016af1280e884887d0ad483da79cb56695\",\"call_id\":\"call_Sbf0ixtNa0QbpETKxKRLihnw\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"tools call mail.draft --json - <<'JSON'\\\\n{\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"dana@example.test\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"subject\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI’ll bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review. Here’s the sheet: https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThanks,\\\\\\\\nSam\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reply_to\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"msg_b43aa55aa79f4528\\\\\\\"}\\\\nJSON\\\",\\\"timeout\\\":30}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_Sbf0ixtNa0QbpETKxKRLihnw\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"draft\\\": \\\"msg_e8b473055141466d\\\",\\n  \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_d76a277fbb8a427d\\\",\\n  \\\"to\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\"\\n}\\n\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be04-3cf8-75da-a5e3-4a40cd2ba068\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
